{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6dda9b4c504bad80fd4308d62fb52fb41f3aefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a737670d481129e2ead6d7223437f3cf70ea53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are whole numbers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed6855ab270c3d4d953e77fc7c9bc950bf30b0f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit \\times \\Delta =36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />.  The largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/5/265c4ead0a7b7f5ec075c78a05df635910d17ecb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit + \\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/5/5d5865a69dbad2a68e4e9f1ff6bd97b30eb1c466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 13 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 20\\ \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"381\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6dda9b4c504bad80fd4308d62fb52fb41f3aefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a737670d481129e2ead6d7223437f3cf70ea53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> can be swapped to get the same sum, only cases where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab9c24543e7189bc3d528279b13c293e0d78852.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\diamondsuit \\geq \\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" /> need to be considered.  These cases are shown in the table:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/4/3d4b845dfe3ac5e8b23b734971756edf7d61e360.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|} \\multicolumn{3}{}{} \\\\ \\hline \\diamondsuit &amp; \\Delta &amp; \\diamondsuit + \\Delta \\\\ \\hline 36 &amp; 1 &amp; 37 \\\\ \\hline 18 &amp; 2 &amp; 20 \\\\ \\hline 12 &amp; 3 &amp; 15 \\\\ \\hline 9 &amp; 4 &amp; 13 \\\\ \\hline 6 &amp; 6 &amp; 12 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"124\" />\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/6/7c64fefdd172f139f580e6fade1308fc9e3103e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 37}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"64\" height=\"30\" /> is the largest possible sum.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We notice that the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/2/ef268524a2f17cac4c13942f7f9142f91cddf9f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x + \\frac{36}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"38\" /> is convex with a minimum at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea7da1b75cc1a945018db7316c26d618ca11ff9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, so we seek to pick a value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> far from 6. To ensure that the answers are positive integers, we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/4/dd4744c45e8754d33c1461fc0eae806ed9ca39d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, from which we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b641a9645b4d749cad71a7dff2fbf06084d89751.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" />, the maximum.\n</p><p>-GaloisTorrent\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22a7e058f4023e096d9da234b2a4d3c1fc2c1ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\times 36 = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/b/8ab70f720ac228669009120ebd2edcd9666bca10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+36=37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/6/7c64fefdd172f139f580e6fade1308fc9e3103e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 37}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"64\" height=\"30\" /> is the highest answer choice it must be correct.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016182208\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 159/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2302/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3650/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.561      1 -total\n 58.51%    7.349      1 Template:AJHSME_box\n 39.52%    4.964      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8084:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016182208 and revision id 282645. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}